## mutate: 새 변수


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
df_pt %>% mutate(
  Age_group = ifelse(Age_Tx >= 65, "≥65", "<65"),
  size_cm   = size_mm / 10,
  BED_group = case_when(
    PTVmean_BED10 >= 100 ~ "≥100 Gy",
    PTVmean_BED10 >= 80  ~ "80-99 Gy",
    TRUE                 ~ "<80 Gy"
  )
)
```

